		{
			description: [
				"Get dependable tools, food and shelter before chasing strange structures. The modded world rewards preparation."
				"Build the first base around repeatable routines: a safe bed, cooked food, labelled storage, spare tools, and a visible mine entrance. Decoration can begin immediately, but survival infrastructure keeps every later project enjoyable."
				"The first chapter of the Chronicle calls this the Hearth Test: could a new player arrive at night, understand the room, eat, sleep, replace a tool, and learn where everyone went without asking for rescue?"
				"Once the method works, label its inputs, outputs, controls, route, or habitat in plain language and show one teammate. Shared documentation turns a completed quest into knowledge that remains useful when the original player is offline."
			]
